t make Claude Code better. One prompt that sets them all up, then a short breakdown of each."}]]}],["$","$L8","rea-reverse-engineer-anything",{"href":"/vault/rea-reverse-engineer-anything","className":"post","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"cover","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/covers/rea-reverse-engineer-anything.webp","width":1200,"height":800,"alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async"}],["$","canvas",null,{"aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"post-meta","children":[["$","b",null,{"children":"Tools"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"3 min"}]]}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"post-title","children":"REA: reverse engineer any feature from any app"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"post-excerpt line-clamp-3","children":"REA lets Claude Code look inside an app you don't have the code for, work out how a feature you like actually works, and build your own version of it. Free and open source. Repo up top, a one prompt install, then how to use it."}]]}]]}]]}]
